@@ -2,6 +2,10 @@
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- Added `AuthStorageOptions.accountMode` (`"balanced"` or `"sequential"`) and the `drainSequentially` ranking-strategy flag. In `sequential` mode the Claude strategy serves every session from one stored account at a time, stores the account that served last under `account:active:<provider>`, and moves to the next account only when the active one is blocked or spent. It does not hand back after a reset.
+
 ## [18.14.2] - 2026-10-31
 
 ### Breaking Changes
